# Netlify SPA fallback — serve index.html for any path so React Router
# can handle client-side routes on a direct hit / refresh (e.g. /offer,
# /about, /articles/:slug). 200 = rewrite (URL stays put), not a redirect.
# Real static files (favicon, images, sitemap.xml) are matched first, so
# only unmatched routes fall through to the app.
